<title>POLAND: Zasada to sell subsidiary for $7 mln.</title>
<headline>Zasada to sell subsidiary for $7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish automotive group Zasada SA has signed a deal on selling its stake in car producer Fabryka Samochodow Specjalizowanych SHL SA to Italy's Metallurgica- Assemblaggi-Carpenterie for $7 million, Zasada said.</p>
<p>Zasada said in a Tuesday statement the agreement provided for selling a 55.7-percent stake in the firm, which is one of its biggest subsidiaries and employs 1,400.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
